  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Rummikub. Logic: groups (same number, different colors), runs (3+ consecutive same color), jokers wild; initial 30; table manipulation; penalty for failed move.',
    Player: 'Rummikub: draw one from the pool or meld; first meld 30+; manipulate table; first to empty rack wins.',
    objective: 'Be the first to get rid of all your tiles by melding them in valid groups and runs on the table; you may also rearrange existing table melds when adding from hand.',
    gameplay: 'Each turn: either draw one tile from the pool or meld. First meld must total at least 30 from hand (groups of same number in different colors, runs of three or more consecutive same color). After that you may add tiles and manipulate table melds; at least one tile from hand must be played each turn. First to empty their rack wins.',
    keyRules: [
      'Groups: three or four tiles of the same number in different colors; runs: three or more consecutive numbers in the same color (1 low, no 12-13-1).',
      'Jokers substitute for any tile; if you replace a joker with the real tile you must use the joker in a meld the same turn.',
      'Failed manipulation within time limit: revert table, take back your tiles, draw three as penalty.',
    ],
